}"}, {"function_name": "UART_EndTxTransfer", "function_type": "IRQ", "functionality": "End ongoing Tx transfer on UART peripheral by disabling TXEIE and TCIE interrupts and setting UART state to READY", "classification_reason": "Function performs interrupt disable operations (ATOMIC_CLEAR_BIT for USART_CR1_TXEIE and USART_CR1_TCIE) and manages UART state transitions, which are interrupt-related operations. It is called during transmission completion or error scenarios to clean up interrupt settings.", "has_replacement": true, "function_replacement": "static void UART_EndTxTransfer(UART_HandleTypeDef *huart)
{
